TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Az önce{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} konfetileri izlerken
rüzgârda süzülen güzel bir
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}tüy {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}gördüm! Ağla yakalayıp{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
sakladım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
tabii.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Umarım daha çok vardır!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Llevamos el mismo conjunto!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Es fantástico, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}a ver si logramos
contagiar el espíritu del Carnaval.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bak!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Aynı kıyafeti giymişiz!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Kasabada dans edersek başkaları
da {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Festivale {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}eğlencesine{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} katılır bence!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Tu portes le déguisement idéal,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
c'est parfaitement dans le ton !
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Comme moi, en fait, hi hi !

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}No se me da demasiado bien seguir
el ritmo de la música, así que{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} 
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}bailo según me dicta el corazón.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Come dance with me,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
We'll celebrate the end of winter
together!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Ven a bailar conmigo,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Celebremos junt{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}s esta primavera
que nos regala la naturaleza!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Komm, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Tanzen wir!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Wir müssen schließlich den Frühling
willkommen heißen!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Bugün herkes ne kadar keyifli,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}
!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ayaklarım müziğe kendiliğinden uyuyor.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Arriva la primavera!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sento la forza dell'erba che
mi spunta sotto i piedi...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ma forse sono solo coriandoli verdi!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tanzen am Morgen, Tanzen am
Mittag und Tanzen die ganze{{TAG:0003:002A:}}
NACHT!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:001A:}}Äh...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} hallo.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}J'ai mangé comme quatre à midi !{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Comme ça, j'ai suffisamment de
réserves pour danser des heures !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sonra dansa devam etmek için
enerji gerekirse diye bugün{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
kocaman bir öğle yemeği yedim!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Good evening!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Are your toes still
tapping?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:000A:}} My toes are a little tired,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
to be honest.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Everyone's out celebrating {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Festivale{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
today!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}} Now, where did I put my
dancing shoes?

{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} That's right.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} It's {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Festivale{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
I thought things seemed a little
different outside.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}¡Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Anda, pero si hoy es Carnaval!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ya decía yo que notaba algo
distinto afuera.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} È vero, oggi è {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Carnevale{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Mi sembrava ci fosse qualcosa
di diverso nell'aria.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Natürlich!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Heute ist {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Karneval{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hab mir doch gleich gedacht, dass
irgendwas draußen anders aussieht.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Herkes {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Festivale{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} kutlarken öyle
güzel eğleniyor ki!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Gülümsememek mümkün değil.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¿Quieres que hagamos un juego?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Si ganas, te doy mi plumita.
Si gano yo, pues me das tú la tuya.{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
¡A jugar!
Mejor no

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bir oyun oynamak ister misin?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Sen kazanırsan{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sana bir tüy
veririm.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ben kazanırsam{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sen bana bir tüy verirsin.{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Olur!
Yok, sağ ol.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bist du sicher?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Gut, wie du magst.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sag mir Bescheid, falls du deine
Meinung änderst.
